  "description": "Extra (§4.9). An 8 x 8 city whose row z = 0 is water (bytes 200, one body). Two type-1 ferry lots at x = 1 and x = 5, each (x,1)-(x,2) with the departure and arrival markers at (x,2) and the water marker at (x,1), whose water cell is (x,0). The second activation routes the two water cells: 5 cells, cost r24(5 x 0.01) = 0x3D4CCCCC; A -> B route 00 01 00 40 04 AA, B -> A 00 05 00 40 04 00. The departure cell gets wormhole bit 4 and records for networks 0 and 1 (connCount 1, type 0, invCapTable[0] = 0x3A83126F). GetAllFerryRoutes lists each terminal's links; GetFerryRouteBetweenTiles(1,2,5,2) returns A's link to B. Removing A deletes B's link back, runs no rebuild (bit 4 stays) and decrements the type count. The periodic pass over the remaining terminal posts 0x2C06BA82 when the list is exhausted.",
